# Slowdown doesn't shorten the button buffer: it counts the slowed fighter's own frames. After p1's red Roman Cancel
# (frame 6, freeze 6-11), p2 runs at half speed, getting its own frames on 13, 15, 17… It leaves blockstun on frame
# 47; its 5a pressed on frame 43 is 4 match frames old then but only 2 of its own, so it comes out as a reversal.
setup: p1 character scenario_dummy
setup: p2 character scenario_dummy
setup: p1 x = -30000
setup: p2 x = 30000
setup: module meter 5000 0 0 0 10000 0
setup: module roman_cancel 112 3 3 5000 15 6 40 1 2
frame 1: p1 5a
frames 1-40: p2 4
frame 6: p1 5a+b+c
frame 43: p2 5a

frame 6: expect p1 event module
frame 46: expect p2 state = blockstun
frame 47: expect p2 move = 5a
frame 47: expect p2 move_frame = 1
